    "body": "Looking at <https://heycam.github.io/webidl/#es-map-get-has>, I think the WebRTC spec could be written in a way that would preserve the sub-dictionaries' properties. (Unfortunately, the spec has so much hand-waving that there's no way to tell what's supposed to be going on.) It wouldn't work for read-write maplikes with derived dictionaries, but I guess that problem is not specific to maplikes.\r\n\r\nI don't know what's going on with the keyframes case; too much prose.",
