    "created_at": "2018-07-21T07:56:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-21T07:56:38Z",
    "body": "Adding [WebCrypto case](https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#cryptokey-interface) which also uses `object` for a union of dictionaries:\r\n\r\n```webidl\r\n[SecureContext,Exposed=(Window,Worker)]\r\ninterface CryptoKey {\r\n  readonly attribute KeyType type;\r\n  readonly attribute boolean extractable;\r\n  readonly attribute object algorithm; // union of subdictionaries of KeyAlgorithm\r\n  readonly attribute object usages; // just returns a sequence.\r\n};\r\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
