    "updated_at": "2018-07-23T03:18:31Z",
    "body": "Right, for the \"union of dictionaries\" case as a return value, `object` works ok.  The amount of spec prose you have to write in this case is the same as if you actually allowed unions of dictionaries in IDL, right?",
